        "respondent": "Harbourside Hotel Ltd",
        "claim": "To recover the value of stolen property from the hotel after items were stolen from her room.",
        "legal_basis": "The exclusion notice on the bedroom door is not part of her contract with the hotel.",
        "fact_refs": [
